(213, 3, 'Fossilized Raptor', 'There is something unsual about these raptor bones. Whenever you look away, they seem to move slightly on their own.', 1, 9504083, 100, 0, 75, 3.0, 15, 5),
(215, 6, 'Tiny Bronze Scorpion', 'The orcs of Azeroth originally inhabited the world of Draenor, the source of most of these ancient orcish artifacts. At first, orcs were a largely peaceful people, but they turned to outright barbarity under the influence of the Burning Legion. The orcs arrived in Azeroth through the Dark Portal and fought against the Alliance in two wars. Another may be on the horizon.', 0, 9504084, 45, 2, 300, 0.0, 15, 4),
