(237, 6, 'Headdress of the First Shaman', 'You have found some scraps of a cowl fashioned out of a wolf''s head. And yet, for all its simplicity, you suspect that this item is old, important and powerful.', 1, 9504093, 130, 3, 300, 4.0, 4, 3),
(239, 2, 'Anklet with Golden Bells', 'The draenei were originally eredar who fled from the Burning Legion and settled on the world of Draenor, where they came into contact with the orcs. When the blood elves arrived, many draenei fled again, this time coming to Azeroth, where they joined the Alliance. ', 0, 9504094, 45, 2, 300, 0.0, 15, 4),
