(262, 27, 'Intricate Treasure Chest Key', 'The vrykul are a race of giant warriors native to the Howling Fjord in Northrend. They have a close affinity with the sea and with native proto-drakes. Many vrykul were absorbed into the vast armies of the Lich King.', 0, 9504104, 45, 2, 375, 0.0, 15, 4),
