(9504093, 15, 4, 'Headdress of the First Shaman', 950493, 4, 0, 0, 0, -1, -1, 1, 1, 1, 'You have found some scraps of a cowl fashioned out of a wolf''s head. And yet, for all its simplicity, you suspect that this item is old, important and powerful.'),
