(9504105, 15, 4, 'Nifflevar Bearded Axe', 950505, 4, 0, 0, 0, -1, -1, 1, 1, 1, 'This axe''s blade is asymmetrical, with a long cutting edge. You suspect it might retain its magic if you could reassemble it.'),
