(9504119, 15, 4, 'Blessing of the Old God', 950519, 4, 200000, 50000, 0, -1, -1, 1, 1, 1, 'You have discovered a very bad thing. It hurts your mind to even look at fragments of this artifact and you worry that it might drive you insane were you to complete the final object.'),
(9504120, 15, 4, 'Puzzle Box of Yogg-Saron', 950520, 4, 200000, 50000, 0, -1, -1, 1, 1, 1, 'Each of the fragments of this artifact emits a nonsense whisper that blends into a maddening susurrus as you accumulate more objects. You hope that you know what you''re doing.'),
